From ac9e4d876320bec58d6e207d1d2247ded98faa7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 04:50:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] fix(reconciler): report a missing scheduler or workflow
 runtime as Ready=False

When a resource needed an allocation or a workflow but no scheduler or
workflow runtime was injected, the reconciler skipped those steps, recorded
the dedup key and reported Ready=True "Reconciled" although nothing had
been done.

Check for the required executors before any side effect and return
Ready=False with reason SchedulerUnavailable or WorkflowRuntimeUnavailable
instead, without recording the dedup key. Nothing is allocated when there
is no runtime to deploy it.
